OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThickening
OL,6,Fcloud will bring some light and patchy
OL,7,Frain from the west this evening. Then
OL,8,Fthe west will see showery rain
OL,9,Fovernight, but dry across the east.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTuesday:FCloud and rain will spread
OL,12,Fsoutheast during the morning, becoming
OL,13,Fdrier and eventually brighter during
OL,14,Fthe afternoon.
OL,15,
OL,16,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FDry
OL,17,Ffor most of Wednesday but rain
OL,18,Fspreading northeast later. Bright
OL,19,Fspells and a few showers on Thursday.
OL,20,FShowers or longer spells of rain on
OL,21,FFriday.
